<!--
  ACCIDENT glyph: an impact starburst above a car body.

  Silhouette-first: the eight-point burst is unlike any other incident glyph in
  the set, so the category is readable with colour stripped out entirely (a
  colour-blind user, or a glance at a sun-washed screen). Drawn in solid white
  on the category badge; no gradients or hairlines, which vanish at the ~24dp
  the marker actually renders at on a moving map.
-->
